============================================================

Create one canonical registry for Anthropic beta headers.

For each:

feature
header
introduced
status
models
API surface
replacement
retirement/removal date
source
last_verified

Search the repository for raw strings:

anthropic-beta
*-2025-*
*-2026-*

Identify duplication and stale headers.

Requests must not accidentally send mutually incompatible beta headers.

Add validator tests.

============================================================
19. ENDPOINT REGISTRY
============================================================

Consider one auditable endpoint registry for non-SDK/raw HTTP surfaces:

name
method
path
auth type
beta header
pagination
status

Especially for:

Compliance
Admin
Managed Agents
MCP tunnels
enterprise endpoints

Tests should verify actual final URL generation.

============================================================
20. HTTP CONTRACT TEST LAYER
============================================================

Create transport-level tests independent of implementation constants.

Capture outgoing requests and assert:

method
URL
headers
query params
JSON payload
timeout
auth behavior

Do NOT build expected values by importing the same endpoint constants
under test.

This protects against self-confirming tests.

============================================================
21. ERROR TAXONOMY
============================================================

Normalize Anthropic failures.

Design stable application exceptions such as:

AnthropicAuthenticationError
AnthropicPermissionError
AnthropicRateLimitError
AnthropicOverloadedError
AnthropicBadRequestError
AnthropicModelUnavailableError
AnthropicBudgetReached
AnthropicRefusal
AnthropicTimeoutError
AnthropicTransportError

Do not erase the original request ID/error details.

Never include API credentials in exception strings.

============================================================
22. RETRY POLICY
============================================================

Audit resilience.py carefully.

Retries should be model/API aware.

Do not retry:

authentication errors
permission failures
invalid requests
retired model errors
normal refusals
budget_reached

Potentially retry according to policy:

429
529
transient 5xx
connect timeout
read timeout

Use bounded exponential backoff with jitter.

Respect Retry-After where supported.

Add deterministic tests with mocked time/randomness.

============================================================
23. TIMEOUT POLICY
============================================================

No Anthropic network call may have an accidental infinite timeout.

Define explicit:

connect timeout
read timeout
stream idle timeout
total timeout where appropriate

Long-running Managed Agents sessions should use appropriate semantics
rather than an enormous synchronous HTTP timeout.

============================================================
24. SDK VERSION VERIFICATION
============================================================

Determine the current stable Anthropic Python SDK version from official
package/docs sources at execution time.

Record:

installed
minimum supported
latest observed
feature-required minimum

Do NOT automatically require latest merely because it exists.

Detect deprecated SDK usage.

Add command:

zcoder doctor anthropic

Output:

SDK
authentication
configured base URL
optional credentials present/missing
conformance manifest age
model registry state

Never print secret values.

============================================================
