============================================================

The project reportedly has more than 150 flags.

Audit usability.

Do not break existing flags.

Introduce coherent subcommands where beneficial:

zcoder anthropic models ...
zcoder anthropic compliance ...
zcoder anthropic agents ...
zcoder anthropic conformance ...
zcoder anthropic pricing ...
zcoder doctor anthropic

Existing flags become compatibility aliases where necessary.

Generate CLI wiring tests automatically where practical.

