============================================================
48. FINAL CLEAN-ROOM INSTALLATION
============================================================

Before declaring release PASS:

1. clean checkout
2. build artifacts
3. create clean virtual environment
4. install wheel only
5. run CLI smoke tests
6. run representative offline operation
7. verify no imports resolve to repo checkout
8. uninstall
9. install sdist
10. repeat smoke test

============================================================
49. FINAL REQUIRED COMMANDS
============================================================

Run the real commands available in this project.

At minimum:

python -m pytest -q
python main.py --help
python main.py --version
python -m build
git diff --check
git status --short

Do NOT use:

--ignore=tests/test_webapp_server.py

in the final release validation.

Run available:

ruff check .
black --check .
mypy .

Then run:

zcoder release check

or the implementation-equivalent command.

============================================================
50. DEFINITION OF DONE
============================================================

Upgrade-05 is complete only if:

[ ] tests/test_webapp_server.py is no longer hidden from release testing
[ ] full expected offline suite passes
[ ] optional skips are explicitly classified
[ ] full-dependency CI executes optional feature tests
[ ] version decision is evidence-based
[ ] published tag is never rewritten
[ ] wheel builds
[ ] sdist builds
[ ] wheel installs in a clean environment
[ ] CLI runs from installed artifact
[ ] package metadata is consistent
[ ] Anthropic conformance manifest validates
[ ] release-note watermark exists
[ ] model drift can be detected
[ ] pricing drift can be surfaced
[ ] beta headers are centralized/audited
[ ] response metadata contract is tested
[ ] retry/timeout behavior is tested
[ ] secrets are protected
[ ] release gate has meaningful exit codes
[ ] CI consumes the release gate
[ ] docs describe the actual release process
[ ] no P0/P1 defect remains

============================================================
51. FINAL RESPONSE FORMAT
============================================================

Return:

## 1. Baseline
Exact repository/test/version state.

## 2. Hidden Test Investigation
Why test_webapp_server.py was previously ignored.

## 3. Test Recovery
What was fixed and final full-suite counts.

## 4. Version Decision
v1.40.0 vs v1.40.1 vs v1.41.0 and why.

## 5. Packaging Verification
Wheel/sdist/install results.

## 6. Anthropic Conformance Automation
Architecture and commands.

## 7. Drift Detection
Release notes/models/pricing/deprecations.

## 8. Transport & Runtime Hardening
Metadata/retries/timeouts/errors.

## 9. CI/CD
Exact workflows/jobs changed.

## 10. Security/Supply Chain
Secret handling, SBOM, hashes.

## 11. Tests Added
Exact test files and scenarios.

## 12. Final Commands
Actual outputs.

## 13. Files Changed
Exact paths.

## 14. Remaining Gaps
Only real unresolved issues.

## 15. Release Gate

SOURCE_TRUTH:
TESTS:
BUILD:
INSTALL:
VERSION:
MODEL_MATRIX:
PRICING:
CLI_WIRING:
SECURITY:
DOCS:

FINAL:

Do not claim production readiness unless FINAL=PASS
and all mandatory gates passed without hidden exclusions.